An unmarked physical miniature cable-car cabin made from painted steel on a neutral studio shelf with weathered steel cable sample slightly out of focus to one side. Clearly photographed as a scale model in an indoor close-up, not a view of the actual Cheget route. Opaque softly reflective glass, clean cool color and one restrained orange accent. Single photoreal, ultra-realistic editorial studio cover for Kompas, physically plausible real objects and soft directional daylight, true textures and readable shadows, balanced horizontal crop 1.9:1. No people, faces, hands, numbers, text, logos, brands, neon, CG, or watermarks.
